    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;Find your voice, own your story, and elevate your professional life. Although bamboo ceilings, the model minority myth, and other stereotypes may have impeded Asians in America from leadership ranks for decades, this book will empower individuals to overcome these obstacles and guide them throughout their careers and beyond. In addition to simple exercises, strategies, and plenty of real-life examples, each chapter also includes stories from inspirational leaders across industries on how they are constantly breaking barriers. The Visibility Mindset provides actionable resources to apply to your life and is essential reading for communities, schools, companies, and allies&quot;--</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="c">Provided by publisher.</marc:subfield>
